{{!-- Renders cargo-about's JSON model as Markdown, grouped by SPDX license id
    (one <details> per id, via `overview`/`first_of_kind` — same iteration
    idiom as cargo-about's own bundled about.hbs), so a page with hundreds of
    MIT-licensed crates gets one collapsible MIT section, not hundreds of
    copies. Consumed by fancier/src/views/open_source.rs via include_str!,
    rendered through the same pulldown-cmark pipeline as
    fancier/src/views/api_reference.rs. Do not hand-edit the generated
    .md output — edit this template and rerun
    fancier/scripts/generate-oss-notices.sh instead.

    Handlebars-rust ships no eq/length helpers beyond if/unless/each/with,
    so this deliberately avoids expressions those would require. Every
    interpolation below uses triple-stash syntax rather than plain
    double-stash: handlebars HTML-escapes by default (quotes become the
    &quot; entity etc.), which is wrong here since the output is Markdown
    text that pulldown-cmark will itself HTML-escape exactly once when the
    page renders; double-escaping would leave literal entity text visible
    on the page. Fenced with 4 backticks (rather than 3) as cheap insurance
    against a license text that happens to contain a bare triple-backtick
    sequence. --}}
